e Board (ACB) reviews critical IT, information security, and cybersecurity issues [C1, Para 224, 225, 226].", "The Audit Committee of the Board (ACB) may be delegated responsibility by the Board to approve the risk assessment methodology [C3, Para 4, 6].", "The Audit Committee of the Board (ACB) may be delegated responsibility by the Board to approve the Annual Audit Plan [C3, Para 4, 6].", "The Audit Committee of the Board (ACB) shall periodically assess the performance of the Risk-Based Internal Audit (RBIA) [C3, Para 4, 6]."]}. Got: 1 validation error for StringIO
