Exception raised in Job[0]: OutputParserException(Failed to parse StringIO from completion {"statements": ["The compliance function must be independent.", "The compliance function is headed by a designated Chief Compliance Officer (CCO).", "The Chief Compliance Officer may be recruited from outside the bank.", "The Chief Compliance Officer must be appointed through a well-defined selection process using fit-and-proper criteria.", "The senior executive selection committee recommends candidates for Chief Compliance Officer.", "The Board makes the final decision on the Chief Compliance Officer appointment.", "The candidate for Chief Compliance Officer must have no pending vigilance case.", "The candidate for Chief Compliance Officer must have no adverse RBI observation.", "The candidate for Chief Compliance Officer must be not more than 55 years old, subject to the continuity exception.", "The Board holds overall responsibility for oversight of the compliance function.", "The Board must ensure an appropriate compliance policy is in place.", "The Board must ensure the compliance policy is reviewed annually.", "The Board must review the compliance function quarterly.", "The Board must conduct an annual detailed review of the compliance function.", "The Chief Compliance Officer is invited to the quarterly review and annual detailed review.", "The Board must keep the compliance function separate from internal audit.", "The Managing Director & CEO must ensure the presence of an independent compliance function.", "The Managing Director & CEO must ensure adherence to the compliance policy.", "Senior management must establish a written compliance policy.", "Senior management must identify compliance risks annually.", "Senior management must assess compliance risks annually.", "Senior management must report material compliance failures to the Board or ACB.", "The bank must set up a Compliance Department at the bank's Head Office (or controlling office for foreign banks).", "The Compliance Department is headed by the Chief Compliance Officer.", "The Chief Compliance Officer coordinates compliance risk.", "The Chief Compliance Officer supervises compliance staff.", "Compliance staff may be located in business lines.", "Compliance staff must report to the Chief Compliance Officer.", "Compliance staff must not be assigned audit or inspection duties.", "Compliance staff remuneration must not be linked to the specific business line the compliance staff oversee.", "The bank must provide adequate staffing for the compliance function.", "The bank must provide succession planning for the compliance function.", "The bank must ensure the compliance function is free to report irregularities directly to senior management.", "The bank must ensure the compliance function is free to report irregularities directly to the Board.", "The bank must ensure the compliance function is free to report irregularities directly to ACB.", "The bank must empower staff to conduct investigations.", "The bank must empower staff to conduct investigations using external experts at the Chief Compliance Officer's discretion."]}. Got: 1 validation error for StringIO
